{"answer_text":"A shared inbox is often enough for small support teams before a full help desk. The best-rated:\n\n* **Brightdesk Helpdesk:** Strong reporting and automations, though the interface feels dated.\n* **Calmline:** A calm, fast shared inbox with collision detection and CRM sidebars.\n* **Northwind CRM Service Desk:** A full suite with a service desk included in the higher tiers.\n* **Halcyon Sales:** Not a support tool, but integrates with most help desks.\n\n**Recommendation:** Brightdesk is the strongest fit for most teams; Calmline is a lighter alternative.","answer_uid":"01a1f315-50f0-77dc-8172-f0e9803daa00","brand_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a260bfb8c145","collection_mode":"api","cost_usd":0.0046,"created_at":"2026-11-18T08:01:53.400Z","engine":"gemini","extraction_status":"ok","extras":null,"fanouts":["shared inbox collision detection","best shared inbox support team"],"latency_ms":5430,"location_applied":false,"market_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-88a12333f09a","market_name":"United Kingdom","mentions":[{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889d8a28ba29","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":1,"method":"alias","name":"Brightdesk","name_text":"Brightdesk","offsets":[[101,111],[473,483]],"pos":1,"recommended":true,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"mixed","sentiment_reason":"Strengths are noted alongside a clear drawback."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-562a-7171-9ab9-2edaafa5b276","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":2,"method":"llm","name":"Calmline","name_text":"Calmline","offsets":[[196,204]],"pos":2,"recommended":false,"relation":"indirect","sentiment":"positive","sentiment_reason":"Presented as a strong option with concrete strengths."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889a7fe6de41","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":3,"method":"alias","name":"Northwind CRM","name_text":"Northwind CRM","offsets":[[281,294]],"pos":3,"recommended":false,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"neutral","sentiment_reason":"Listed factually with